{"id":"lMTYSuZOqD1y0Ywy","meta":{"instanceId":"854fc77037b45bdc23d26e6d854c588a241b2d0a77bd8b7b85f50a053c985aa7"},"name":"Bill Roaster - WhatsApp (WAHA)","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"6f6a1138-e241-4626-8b86-f6ed5bde4e63","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[256,-64],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Bill Roaster - WhatsApp (WAHA)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow manages shared bills over WhatsApp using WAHA. It accepts whitelisted WhatsApp messages, OCRs receipt photos with Gemini, stores the extracted receipt context, then lets users assign splits by message and sends generated payment requests to the relevant contacts while logging bills in Google Sheets. It also handles payment confirmations by matching WhatsApp senders to bill rows and updating paid status, and runs a daily reminder job for unpaid bills.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure WAHA credentials, session details, and the webhook/trigger so incoming WhatsApp messages and outgoing replies work correctly.\n- Set up Google Sheets credentials and create/configure the expected sheets for contacts, temporary OCR sessions, bill logs, unpaid bill lookups, and reminder metadata.\n- Configure Gemini credentials for receipt/document analysis and OpenRouter credentials for the LLM chains that generate bill and reminder text.\n- Update the whitelist logic with allowed WhatsApp numbers and verify the Config/Config1 nodes have the correct currency code and symbol.\n- Check the scheduled reminder trigger timezone and daily run time, then test the receipt, assignment, payment confirmation, and reminder paths end to end.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the split-parsing code, LLM prompts, reminder frequency/anti-spam rules, currency settings, whitelist, and Google Sheets schema to match your household or team billing process."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8daca5da-ffc0-48b7-aa82-c81c26494304","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[832,-64],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":704,"content":"## WhatsApp intake gate\n\nReceives incoming WAHA WhatsApp events, filters them to whitelisted people, and applies shared currency configuration before downstream processing."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"47c66f0f-ae1e-4a00-96a9-b6900881fc90","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1504,304],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":336,"content":"## Normalize and route message\n\nStandardizes the WAHA payload into common fields and decides whether the incoming message includes a receipt photo or should be handled as text."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"47804be3-8a0b-4830-aa5a-528fcbd31c2c","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1952,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":928,"height":304,"content":"## Receipt OCR session\n\nDownloads receipt media, analyzes the document with Gemini, replies to the chat, and saves the OCR result as temporary session context for a later assignment message."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"09f7d144-bf54-43d6-b68d-c1762b53aea7","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1952,576],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":528,"content":"## Text intent routing\n\nRoutes non-photo messages by checking for assignment syntax and, if not an assignment, checking whether the text is a payment confirmation."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2a66ef9a-93b8-41a3-a06c-441c4d340a71","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2400,416],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":992,"height":512,"content":"## Calculate bill split\n\nRetrieves the saved OCR session, parses the assignment message, calculates shares, uses an LLM to refine the bill text, and composes the final message payload."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"67e6638b-9aa8-479f-bd27-a8f8e2320d86","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3424,464],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":448,"content":"## Match contact data\n\nLooks up the payer contact by WhatsApp number and merges contact details with the composed bill message before sending."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"67dbcdb2-8efa-4751-b6e3-f1707ee7b8c6","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3424,64],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":368,"content":"## Send and log bills\n\nIterates over generated bill items, sends each WhatsApp payment request, and logs the resulting bill records to Google Sheets."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e6996dd6-124f-4857-81c6-c01cec68a39a","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2400,960],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":768,"height":304,"content":"## Find payment record\n\nExtracts identifiers from a payment confirmation message, loads bill records, and matches the sender/message to the relevant bill row."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"be4bd318-3ab7-47bc-9801-07bc86879889","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3200,960],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Mark bill paid\n\nChecks whether a matching row was found and updates that bill’s Google Sheets status to paid."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d621ffea-5416-4a27-81a0-6f3765194d6a","name":"Sticky Note10","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[816,1280],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":304,"content":"## Reminder schedule fetch\n\nRuns the daily reminder trigger, applies the reminder configuration, and retrieves currently unpaid bills from Google Sheets."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"aff10bf8-0751-4e21-897e-f954a058658d","name":"Sticky Note11","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1488,1248],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Evaluate reminder need\n\nCalculates reminder levels, applies anti-spam rules, and branches only bills that should receive a reminder."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e05dd337-0cb6-4bd7-bdf5-86a27f088142","name":"Sticky Note12","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1936,1296],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":768,"height":496,"content":"## Send reminder update\n\nGenerates reminder copy with an LLM, sends the WhatsApp reminder, and records the latest reminder timestamp in Google Sheets."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b7f57258-826c-42cf-87d2-e157a50ef897","name":"When Message Received (WAHA)","type":"@devlikeapro/n8n-nodes-waha.wahaTrigger","position":[880,96],"webhookId":"86e9dd04-0e63-4556-b49f-7d3617994f1d","parameters":{},"typeVersion":202502},{"id":"f21ac3f7-9d17-4cea-b874-f8d2958ab6dc","name":"Normalize WAHA Payload","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1552,480],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Normalize WAHA payload into standard fields used by downstream nodes.\n// ADJUST this if your WAHA webhook payload structure differs.\nconst body = $json.body || $json;\nconst payload = body.payload || body;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    chatId: payload.from,\n    text: payload.body || \"\",\n    hasMedia: !!payload.hasMedia,\n    mediaUrl: payload.media ? payload.media.url : null,\n    mimetype: payload.media ? payload.media.mimetype : null\n  }\n}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"003f17c8-856d-4a69-9738-042f0b977ffd","name":"IF Has Photo (Receipt)?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1776,480],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.hasMedia}}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"9909a474-916e-456a-a9b7-10fac4366c71","name":"IF Assignment Format (contains ':')?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[2000,752],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"regex"},"leftValue":"={{$json.text}}","rightValue":".*:.*"}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"52519068-31f4-4f83-85db-2110b97226fa","name":"IF Payment Confirmation?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[2224,944],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"regex"},"leftValue":"={{$json.text}}","rightValue":"=(paid|done|Paid|Done)"}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"e9e17393-b614-4dba-93e1-092a6c6fc22b","name":"Download Receipt Media (WAHA)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[2000,208],"parameters":{"url":"={{$json.mediaUrl}}","options":{"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"file"}}},"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"wahaApi"},"credentials":{"wahaApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"WAHA WithMi"}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"779e862f-2b06-4f62-88f6-95e1bd06d530","name":"Save Session (temp OCR)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2736,208],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"state":"waiting_assignment","chatId":"={{ $('Normalize WAHA Payload').item.json.chatId }}","ocrData":"={{ $('Analyze document').item.json.content.parts[0].text }}","updatedAt":"={{ $now.toISO() }}"},"schema":[{"id":"chatId","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"chatId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"state","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"state","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"ocrData","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"ocrData","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"updatedAt","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"updatedAt","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":["chatId"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":1681754903,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=1681754903","cachedResultName":"Session"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"83653a7b-4f3d-48d0-8c93-5d612899f5b0","name":"Get Session (saved OCR)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2448,544],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":1681754903,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=1681754903","cachedResultName":"Session"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"b54ebff9-87e6-4522-ae11-17f8247c5357","name":"Parse Assignment & Calculate Split","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2672,544],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const currencySymbol = $('Config').item.json.currencySymbol;\n\nconst allSessions = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst currentChatId = $('Normalize WAHA Payload').item.json.chatId;\n\n// Ambil semua sesi milik chatId yang sedang chat sekarang, urutkan dari paling baru\nconst matchingSessions = allSessions\n  .filter(s => s.chatId === currentChatId)\n  .sort((a, b) => new Date(b.updatedAt) - new Date(a.updatedAt));\n\nif (matchingSessions.length === 0) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      error: \"No matching session found for this chatId\",\n      currentChatId\n    },\n    pairedItem: { item: 0 }\n  }];\n}\n\nconst session = matchingSessions[0];\n\nlet ocr;\ntry {\n  let raw = session.ocrDataClean || session.ocrData || \"\";\n  raw = raw.replace(/```json\\s*/g, '').replace(/```\\s*$/g, '').trim();\n  ocr = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  ocr = { items: [], tax: 0, total: 0 };\n}\n\nconst replyText = $('Normalize WAHA Payload').item.json.text || \"\";\nconst lines = replyText.split('\\n').map(l => l.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n\nfunction normalize(str) {\n  return str\n    .toLowerCase()\n    .replace(/[().,]/g, '')\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')\n    .trim();\n}\n\nfunction findBestMatch(keyword, ocrItems) {\n  const kw = normalize(keyword);\n\n  const numMatch = kw.match(/^#?item\\s*(\\d+)$|^#?(\\d+)$/);\n  if (numMatch) {\n    const idx = parseInt(numMatch[1] || numMatch[2], 10) - 1;\n    if (ocrItems[idx]) return ocrItems[idx];\n  }\n\n  let bestItem = null;\n  let bestScore = 0;\n\n  for (const item of ocrItems) {\n    const itemName = normalize(item.name);\n    if (itemName === kw) return item;\n\n    let score = 0;\n    if (itemName.includes(kw) || kw.includes(itemName)) {\n      score = Math.min(kw.length, itemName.length) / Math.max(kw.length, itemName.length);\n    } else {\n      const kwWords = kw.split(' ');\n      const itemWords = itemName.split(' ');\n      const overlap = kwWords.filter(w => itemWords.includes(w)).length;\n      score = overlap / Math.max(kwWords.length, 1);\n    }\n\n    if (score > bestScore) {\n      bestScore = score;\n      bestItem = item;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return bestScore >= 0.4 ? bestItem : null;\n}\n\nlet assignments = [];\nfor (const line of lines) {\n  const [namePart, itemsPart] = line.split(':');\n  if (!namePart || !itemsPart) continue;\n  const name = namePart.trim();\n  const keywords = itemsPart.split(',').map(s => s.trim());\n  assignments.push({ name, keywords });\n}\n\nif (assignments.length === 0) {\n  const total = ocr.total || ocr.items.reduce((a, b) => a + b.price, 0) + (ocr.tax || 0);\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      name: \"Everyone\",\n      items: ocr.items.map(i => i.name),\n      amount: Math.round(total),\n      currency: currencySymbol,\n      unmatchedKeywords: []\n    },\n    pairedItem: { item: 0 }\n  }];\n}\n\nconst results = assignments.map(a => {\n  const matchedItems = [];\n  const unmatchedKeywords = [];\n\n  for (const kw of a.keywords) {\n    const match = findBestMatch(kw, ocr.items);\n    if (match) {\n      matchedItems.push(match);\n    } else {\n      unmatchedKeywords.push(kw);\n    }\n  }\n\n  const subtotal = matchedItems.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.price, 0);\n  const totalAllItems = ocr.items.reduce((a2, b) => a2 + b.price, 0) || 1;\n  const taxShare = (ocr.tax || 0) * (subtotal / totalAllItems);\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      name: a.name,\n      items: matchedItems.map(i => i.name),\n      amount: Math.round(subtotal + taxShare),\n      currency: currencySymbol,\n      unmatchedKeywords\n    },\n    pairedItem: { item: 0 }\n  };\n});\n\nreturn results;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"99b27af1-c9f8-4c4e-b6dc-ceafc58ee0c8","name":"Compose Final Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3248,544],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForEachItem","jsCode":"const data = $json;\nconst roast = data.text || data.output || `${data.name}, you owe $${data.amount}!`;\n\nconst parsed = $('Parse Assignment & Calculate Split').item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    name: parsed.name,\n    roastMessage: roast,\n    amount: parsed.amount,\n    items: parsed.items,\n    status: \"unpaid\",\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    lastReminderSent: \"\"\n  }\n};"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a9d4fa6f-850c-423f-aec7-998b41a76c1e","name":"Find Contact (waNumber)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3472,752],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":1562484047,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=1562484047","cachedResultName":"Contacts"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"cd9fa2e7-071c-4788-a392-f7c2830ff531","name":"Log Bill to Sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3920,256],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"name":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.name }}","items":"={{$('Compose Final Message').item.json.items.join(', ')}}","amount":"={{$('Compose Final Message').item.json.amount}}","status":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.status }}","waNumber":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.waNumber }}","timestamp":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.timestamp }}","lastReminderSent":"={{$('Compose Final Message').item.json.lastReminderSent}}"},"schema":[{"id":"name","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"name","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"waNumber","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"waNumber","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"items","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"items","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"amount","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"amount","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"timestamp","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"timestamp","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"lastReminderSent","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"lastReminderSent","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Bills"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"f179890f-289a-4c71-aadc-9c22f489f0ec","name":"Cron - Check Reminders (Daily 7PM)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[864,1408],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"triggerAtHour":19}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"836fa42a-e069-4bc3-bb15-9ffd168d7db7","name":"Get Unpaid Bills","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1312,1408],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":354632510,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=354632510","cachedResultName":"Bills"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"e9822096-8dde-40b3-b389-f059fc1df6d8","name":"Calculate Reminder Level & Anti-Spam Guard","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1536,1408],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nconst data = $json;\n\nif (data.lastReminderSent === today) return [];\n\nconst billedAt = new Date(data.timestamp);\nconst now = new Date();\nconst daysDiff = Math.floor((now - billedAt) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n\nlet level = null;\nif (daysDiff >= 7) level = \"savage\";\nelse if (daysDiff >= 3) level = \"firm\";\nelse if (daysDiff >= 1) level = \"gentle\";\n\nif (!level) return [];\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...data, level, today } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"16715a39-5269-45be-9fc2-4f2618ee58b1","name":"IF Reminder Needed?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1760,1408],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEquals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.level}}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"2547b668-8126-46c3-8142-eebd1d8c4925","name":"Update lastReminderSent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2560,1616],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"name":"=","row_number":"={{ $('Get Unpaid Bills').item.json.row_number }}","lastReminderSent":"={{ $json.messageTimestamp }}"},"schema":[{"id":"name","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"name","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"waNumber","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"waNumber","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"items","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"items","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"amount","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"amount","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"timestamp","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"timestamp","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"lastReminderSent","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"lastReminderSent","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"row_number","type":"number","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":true,"required":false,"displayName":"row_number","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":["row_number"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"update","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":354632510,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=354632510","cachedResultName":"Bills"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"20378ea1-e33c-4009-83f5-bce386190fd5","name":"Whitelisted People","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1104,480],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"or","conditions":[{"id":"8400deb0-178b-43b0-a123-967e23107cd9","operator":{"name":"filter.operator.equals","type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.payload._data.key.remoteJidAlt }}","rightValue":"user@example.com"},{"id":"2548cac6-e75c-4322-b162-1fc6abf7cf63","operator":{"name":"filter.operator.equals","type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.payload._data.key.remoteJidAlt }}","rightValue":"user@example.com"}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"a6bac4d9-3228-4759-b686-65b90cea78c2","name":"Analyze document","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini","position":[2224,208],"parameters":{"text":"=You read a photo of a shopping/food receipt and return ONLY valid JSON with no other text, in this format: {\"items\": [{\"name\": string, \"price\": number}], \"tax\": number, \"total\": number}\n\nIMPORTANT — number formatting: this receipt is in {{$('Config').item.json.currencyCode}} currency. Read all prices, tax, and total as full whole numbers in the smallest standard unit for this currency (e.g. do not divide by 1000, do not add unnecessary decimal points unless the currency itself commonly uses cents/decimals, like USD or EUR).\n\nRead this receipt and extract every item, price, tax/service charge, and total as accurate whole numbers.","modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite","cachedResultUrl":"","cachedResultName":"models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite"},"options":{},"resource":"document","inputType":"binary","binaryPropertyName":"=data"},"credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Alicia Gemini"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"34d5137e-59fb-4eb9-a314-a6531dbab395","name":"send message : chatting","type":"@devlikeapro/n8n-nodes-waha.WAHA","position":[2448,208],"parameters":{"text":"=Receipt received ✅\nWho ordered what? Reply using this format:\nName1: item1, item2\nName2: item3","chatId":"={{ $('When Message Received (WAHA)').item.json.payload.from }}","session":"={{ $('When Message Received (WAHA)').item.json.session }}","reply_to":"={{ $('When Message Received (WAHA)').item.json.payload._data.pushName }}","resource":"Chatting","operation":"Send Text","linkPreview":"=","requestOptions":{}},"credentials":{"wahaApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"WAHA WithMi"}},"typeVersion":202502},{"id":"aca490ee-1dc4-46e2-9dfe-d5efec792260","name":"Basic LLM Chain","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[2896,544],"parameters":{"text":"=Write a funny bill message for {{$json.name}} who ordered: {{$json.items.join(', ')}}. Total amount owed: {{ $('Config').item.json.currencySymbol }} {{$json.amount}}","batching":{},"messages":{"messageValues":[{"message":"You write short, funny, light-hearted bill-splitting messages, max 2 sentences. RULES: never joke about body/weight, race, religion, gender, or other sensitive topics. Keep humor focused ONLY on the food/items ordered and the amount owed. Write it in Rupiah Currency."}]},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":1.9},{"id":"d1dcdd57-5628-43d0-8c22-6084e12f00bd","name":"OpenRouter Chat Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","position":[3200,800],"parameters":{"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","options":{}},"credentials":{"openRouterApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"hk_prod_fahmi"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0891eaf1-af46-419a-a4da-7513fff7b243","name":"send message : chatting1","type":"@devlikeapro/n8n-nodes-waha.WAHA","position":[3696,192],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.text }}","chatId":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.waNumber }}","session":"={{ $('When Message Received (WAHA)').item.json.session }}","reply_to":"={{ $('Merge').item.json.name }}","resource":"Chatting","operation":"Send Text","linkPreview":"=","requestOptions":{}},"credentials":{"wahaApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"WAHA WithMi"}},"typeVersion":202502},{"id":"886f226e-cdf8-42e0-8c0d-f8b2e45f84f8","name":"Loop Over Items","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches","position":[3472,256],"parameters":{"options":{}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"0e5830f8-e142-4f81-a447-c6deb266c380","name":"Merge","type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","position":[3696,624],"parameters":{"mode":"combine","options":{},"advanced":true,"mergeByFields":{"values":[{"field1":"name","field2":"name"}]}},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"86d82435-4b58-4c66-bd67-c1e05663af2f","name":"Extract Payment Identifiers","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2448,1088],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Ambil nomor asli dari remoteJidAlt (format: user@example.com)\nconst remoteJidAlt = $('When Message Received (WAHA)').item.json.payload._data.key.remoteJidAlt || \"\";\nconst phoneDigits = remoteJidAlt.split('@')[0]; // ambil angka sebelum @ saja\nconst waNumber = phoneDigits ? `${phoneDigits}@c.us` : null; // samakan format dengan Contacts\n\n// Fallback: coba extract nama kalau user nulis format \"Nama: paid\"\nconst text = $json.text || \"\";\nconst match = text.match(/^(.+?):\\s*(paid|done)/i);\nconst nameFromText = match ? match[1].trim() : null;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    waNumber,\n    nameFromText\n  }\n};"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"427e1f66-d520-4350-b5d5-36d48a121f78","name":"Get All Bills","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2736,1088],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":354632510,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit#gid=354632510","cachedResultName":"Bills"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vnI1Y4HoW2zQXEqDP9fP80-K_sH3HJQDvhAVtQARJLo/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Split Bill - Flowgrammer"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"fahmi sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"fd56aca4-f2d3-495e-86ca-79a0ec520ac3","name":"Match Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3024,1088],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const identifiers = $('Extract Payment Identifiers').item.json;\nconst allBills = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\n\n// Filter HANYA yang masih unpaid, biar gak ke-overwrite tagihan yang udah lunas\nconst unpaidBills = allBills.filter(b => b.status === 'unpaid');\n\n// Tahap 1: match by nomor telepon, ambil yang PALING BARU\nlet candidates = unpaidBills.filter(b => b.waNumber === identifiers.waNumber);\n\n// Tahap 2: fallback ke nama kalau nomor gak match\nif (candidates.length === 0 && identifiers.nameFromText) {\n  candidates = unpaidBills.filter(b => \n    b.name && b.name.trim().toLowerCase() === identifiers.nameFromText.toLowerCase()\n  );\n}\n\nif (candidates.length === 0) {\n  return { json: { found: false } };\n}\n\n// Ambil yang timestamp-nya paling baru\ncandidates.sort((a, b) => new Date(b.timestamp) - new Date(a.timestamp));\nconst matched = candidates[0];\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    found: true,\n    row_number: matched.row_number,\n    name: matched.name\n  }\n};"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"cebb563b-0a9f-4ab2-9e8c-a791a1e09ce0","name":"IF Row Found?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[3248,1120],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{$json.found}}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"6986742a-c0bf-47bc-a76c-ec759577e30b","name":"Config","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[1328,480],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"5b1def57-2dac-46ac-b12d-8ad587d3b09a","name":"currencyCode","type":"string","value":"IDR"},{"id":"b5c6f6f5-1329-43cf-b99a-5cc667b2486e","name":"currencySymbol","type":"string","value":"Rp"}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.5},{"id":"0e76726b-1cd6-405d-8bf1-9515b433e4b2","name":"Basic LLM Chain1","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[1984,1616],"parameters":{"text":"=Write a '{{$json.level}}' level reminder for {{$json.name}} who still owes {{ $('Config1').item.json.currencySymbol }} {{$json.amount}} for: {{$json.items}}.","batching":{},"messages":{"messageValues":[{"message":"You write short (max 2 sentences), funny bill-payment reminder messages. Tone escalates by level: gentle = friendly teasing, firm = slightly more pointed, savage = dramatic/over-the-top but still polite and never touching sensitive topics like body/race/religion/gender."}]},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":1.9},{"id":"b7bd845b-9116-4b48-8a26-ae248da88c4a","name":"OpenRouter Chat Model1","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","position":[2080,1632],"parameters":{"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","options":{}},"credentials":{"openRouterApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"hk_prod_fahmi"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a7d82aa8-9284-44e6-a684-36ffaf73f196","name":"send message : chatting2","type":"@devlikeapro/n8n-nodes-waha.WAHA","position":[2336,1616],"parameters":{"text":